eased. The increase in the \(\Delta H_{\mathrm{tr}}\) and \(\Delta S_{\mathrm{tr}}\) values as a function of the salt concentration in Figure 6B,C for both the polypeptides has already been studied for other elastin-like systems,9,38 and this behavior is attributed to the presence of a more well-structured sphere of hydrophobic hydration around
